(F5 T3 B: group_materi_plasti_maximum_iterations wins over the global
 materi_plasti_maximum_iterations for its group: group 1000, global 1,
 so sigyy is the converged plastic -3.3935 {as plasti_apply1 without
 plasti_apply -no}.)
